{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_06",
  "title": "怒意漫延",
  "storyCode": "TW-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c79cf6ac769d2395d040fd58af57c564471251c5c30e3047a4ce2c03c69d82d3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 6下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们就这么白白被他们利用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果他们真的借了“整合运动”这个名号，会怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们一定会这么宣称。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一定会被追捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是这种规模的城镇，奈何不了我们，可......可如果是一整座移动城邦呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱塔尼亚诸城高塔耸立，睥睨大地的那些大银行家大音乐家大贵族们，随便拎一个出来就够我们喝一壶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傲慢会毁了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也正是傲慢，才让莱塔尼亚那肮脏的侵略性得以遏制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也许不该在沃伦姆德闹下去了，继续这样，我们可无路可走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我们不应该在战场上相见。这里......这里不是战场，不该是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的时间不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——？你在和谁说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......感慨一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很快，冬天就会来了，我们别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡达",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......这感觉好像不太妙呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那么，还有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以防万一，我想请问塞弗林长官，八具遗体的身份......是如何确认的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "体型，性别，大致年龄，以及镇内的失踪名单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但现在不是讨论那场火灾的时候，眼下有更紧急的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不否认，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有什么发现吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据我们接触的整合运动所说，他们在火灾中丧生的感染者人数是“四名”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们有必要在意敌人的话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恕我直言，这完全有必要，“在意”和“信任”是两回事，双方存在误会的可能性很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我依旧不觉得这能解决问题，我甚至觉得......就算揭开火灾的真相，也制止不了事情变得更坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对我们而言，有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那也恕我直言，从中途开始，亚叶小姐，你的表现都显得有些过于主观了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你必须——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只会为了沃伦姆德而战，这是我的职责，所以我对各位的正义心......并不感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有必要为了真相而对罗德岛负责，并不因你的复仇欲负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不，你说得对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去冷静一下......丽萨在照顾伤员，我......我去帮她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么我们已经得出结论了，无论如何，将以收复十二音街区为最优先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全面开战不可避免，罗德岛的各位将着力于自律施术单元的争夺，以及，监视那队有萨卡兹在其中的武装分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......正面控制暴徒的任务就交给我们，最困难的事，就交给你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断崖",
      "speakerId": "char_294_ayer",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，嗯......刚才话是不是说太重了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，塞弗林长官。那座街道里的叛乱分子，门外的那些愤怒的镇民，你从他们眼里看到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果连我们也被冲昏了头脑，这座城镇沃伦姆德就已经宣告灭亡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而且无论真相如何，“整合运动再度出现并摧毁了莱塔尼亚的一座城镇”，这种事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那么多的牺牲和分别之后，我不想再看见一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......断崖，联络一下卡达，汇合时间已经到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去看看那些感染者战俘的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官？我看到亚叶小姐已经离开了，会议结束了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真大声啊，外面的家伙们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁能忍受家园被破坏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们毁了我的店，还打伤了我的孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些该死的叛徒！忘恩负义！忘恩负义的叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要战斗！我们要战斗！我们要战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我们要战斗！我们要战斗！我们要战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘶，看窗外，他们人人都是正义的化身了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯父，您不该抽烟了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这样就好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话是这么说......你的感染程度还很轻，不要随便滥用源石技艺喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开什么玩笑——我可是莱塔尼亚人，受过高等教育的莱塔尼亚人，怎么可能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是......不是战斗的问题，不能用源石技艺的话，我家的冰箱都用不了啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就正常地通过装置使用，不要刺激体内源石，这样就可以避免感染恶化了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......当时贪便宜，用的是需要术师操作的二手便宜货......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......你、你这个外来人又懂什么？我还能回到正常的生活吗！？我们要反抗的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，你记住好好调养，避免恶化，还是很健康的。啊，但是切记不能随便施术！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_067",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反抗......反抗的是......哦，算了，和一个小孩子说什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么下一个——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是个老爷爷？明明已经这么一把年纪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵呵，九只尾巴的沃尔珀，这可真是少见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......这么说来，最近一直在打听冬灵人的外乡人，就是你了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是的......请问老爷爷你哪里受伤了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？没有，没有，我只是来自首送死的而已......我已经老眼昏花啦，现在都在犯困......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送、送死？别说这么可怕的话呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，我就是冬灵族人，最后的冬灵族人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，孩子，你惊讶的样子也那么可爱，那么的......没有敌意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后的......？可大家都说，是冬灵人率先帮助了叛乱的感染者队伍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，只有在被仇恨点燃的时候，他们才会想起自己的血统，血统只是借口......他们在仇恨别的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能多听我说两句吗？反正，我已经是你们的阶下囚了，我也不打算......再做什么，我老了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，嗯......不过您的年纪很大了，就算只是外伤我也该先帮您治疗一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，爷爷我的身体还算强壮......不，我还是老了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "族人们......大多去了其他的地区，或者是，和沃伦姆德的人们通婚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到最后，真正的冬灵人还剩几个？只剩我们几个老家伙了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爷爷......你做过什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......杀过人。杀过很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来沃伦姆德的商旅，胆敢进入荒野的贵族......我们杀过很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一开始，我们都觉得，这是正当的复仇，是理所当然的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以老家伙们干得格外卖力，年轻人们大多袖手旁观，这已经和他们的生活无关了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，复仇，复仇。我们杀不掉那些背叛者，杀不掉那些腐朽的贵族，到头来，我们还是把仇恨宣泄在了那么多无辜者的头上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们打不败莱塔尼亚，打不败它的法律，打不败移动城邦引擎的轰鸣声——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们开始放弃。放弃了之后，我逃进了沃伦姆德，其他老家伙都被塞弗林挨个解决掉了，那家伙是个狠角色，从不手软。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......听说他会陪着将死的敌人，一起抽一支烟。就是现代烟，工业烟草，都不咋地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我呢，我用捡来的铁皮搭了个窝......就在沃伦姆德的地下，塞弗林没有赶尽杀绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕死吗？我不怕死，你可要相信我，沃尔珀的小姑娘，我真的不怕死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想在穷其一生的复仇也落空了之后，听听一座城镇的动力炉轰轰作响的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许有一天，沃伦姆德也会扩建成为一座移动城邦，也许有一天，沃伦姆德会就此消亡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......嗨......作为冬灵人的我，第一次看见那滚烫的锅炉令城镇开拔时，我气愤吗？我无奈吗？我只记得，当时我哭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是多么的澎湃，炙热，多么不可阻挡......就靠我手里的弓和短剑，怎么才能解决它呢？我爱上了它了......爱上这个凶器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是毕德曼做到了，奸诈的小子......一个天灾信使，一个外人，做到了我这一辈子也没敢去做的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——慢、慢着，老爷爷！你说，你刚才说毕德曼——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得这是莱塔尼亚某位天灾信使的名字，但他应该在火灾之中丧生了才对——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔？这我可就不清楚了......发号施令的人的确是他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道那种无力感吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看着毕德曼......带着那些感染者们，施术，破坏，动力炉毁于一旦的时候，我好无力啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来那个过去征服过我们的东西，也只是普通的铁疙瘩——真让人犯困。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我在听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要急着去复仇、去战斗，先听我说......小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冬灵人不是这场纷争的起因......至少，现在不是了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多少沃伦姆德人都有冬灵人的血统......？最早建立这座城镇的，就是我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冬灵，冬灵就是沃伦姆德这颗月亮啊......他们，自己毁了自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原来是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你看，沃尔珀小姑娘，前面的路往哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面......前面只是普通的街道呀？通向议事厅的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是往山里去的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长旗在飘......十二个弯折的山道......旅人和风雪......啊......动力炉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老爷爷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，是我记错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是入山的路，老爷爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......你都听到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一直在和什么东西兜圈子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个本以为死了的天灾信使，却在指挥暴徒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕德曼......是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪\n那是一节易折的树枝♪\n冬灵啊，冬灵♪\n倦于长久的生和长久的死♪\n它顽强坚韧地唱它的歌♪\n唱了一个夏天♪\n一个冬天之久♪\n冬灵啊，冬灵♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
